Z||000001||avengador1||11-03-2001||04:59 PM||||try <A HREF="http://www.mpmotorsports.net" TARGET=_blank>www.mpmotorsports.net</A>  they have one for $55. I saw it listed originally on eBay. I just bought one for my Fiero and it has six studs with nuts and washers already installed. all it needs is some finishing sanding, priming, and painting. It comes in a white gelcoat that is a little rough but not bad. Its listed as a 79 Mustang/ Fiero Hood scoop. They also have some other styles you might be interested in.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
